msgid "Project metadata"
msgstr "项目元数据"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:4
#: 0fe69fa2474f49be82028e686d34520b
msgid ""
"``metadata.json`` is read by the Conan recipe, the root CMake project, and "
"the documentation builder. Change a setting there when you intend to change "
"all of those consumers; edit ``MeasurementConfig`` or a measurement JSON "
"file to change an algorithm parameter."
msgstr ""
"Conan 配方、根目录 CMake 工程和文档构建器都会读取 "
"``metadata.json``。只有在希望这些使用方一起改变时才修改该文件；算法参数应在 ``MeasurementConfig`` 或测量用 "
"JSON 文件中调整。"

