msgstr "``dependencies.cpp``"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:24
#: b538402991314600b552ccf4f70c1578
msgid ""
"Names CMake targets linked to the C++ library. Package versions are in "
"``conandata.yml``."
msgstr "列出链接到 C++ 库的 CMake 目标。包版本写在 ``conandata.yml``。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:26
#: d2d2dd4cd45845e68fbb22e764d1eb53
msgid "``doc_languages`` / ``doc_versions``"
msgstr "``doc_languages`` / ``doc_versions``"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:27
#: ed4bc0f41c70493a9e860b9dca6d43f1
msgid ""
"Select the Doxygen/Sphinx build variants. These are documentation labels, "
"not the package's semantic version."
msgstr "选择 Doxygen/Sphinx 的语言和文档版本；这些标签不是包的语义版本号。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:29
#: 919366266767465ea08469e96a0c3f83
msgid "``workflow_triggers.docs``"
msgstr "``workflow_triggers.docs``"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:30
#: d7ec36681230465f81d2ac74c949e2ad
msgid ""
"Enables the documentation CI trigger. A local ``docs/build.py`` run does not"
" depend on this switch."
msgstr "启用文档 CI 触发器。本地运行 ``docs/build.py`` 不依赖此开关。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:33
#: ba8eb6486f1b4a8f97f0602499fbe906
msgid ""
"The dependency map is a build target map, not a list of versions. For "
"example, the ``PCL`` entry names ``PCL::PCL`` while ``conandata.yml`` "
"selects ``pcl/1.14.1``. Keep the two in sync when changing dependencies."
msgstr ""
"依赖映射列出的是构建目标，而不是版本。例如 ``PCL`` 项指定 ``PCL::PCL``，``conandata.yml`` 则选择 "
"``pcl/1.14.1``。更换依赖时需同时检查两处。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:38
#: 55d620f646b14c109262e60ce2cbb19e
msgid "Documentation sources"
msgstr "文档源文件"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/meta.rst:40
#: 2bfd237419254dd0a6ee09318bc5cd99
msgid ""
"Doxygen reads the paths and suffixes selected by ``doc_doxygen_folders`` and"
" ``doc_doxygen_suffix``. Sphinx reads pages from ``docs/sphinx/source`` and "
"Chinese translations from ``docs/sphinx/locales/zh_CN``. Run ``python "
"docs/build.py`` from the repository root to generate both; the script writes"
" its output under ``docs/doxygen/build`` and ``docs/sphinx/build``."
msgstr ""
"Doxygen 扫描 ``doc_doxygen_folders`` 和 ``doc_doxygen_suffix`` 指定的路径与后缀。Sphinx "
"从 ``docs/sphinx/source`` 读取页面，从 ``docs/sphinx/locales/zh_CN`` "
"读取中文翻译。在仓库根目录运行 ``python docs/build.py`` 可生成两套文档；输出分别位于 "
"``docs/doxygen/build`` 和 ``docs/sphinx/build``。"

